> @@ -49,6 +49,11 @@ properties:
>    reg:
>      maxItems: 1
>  
> +  samsung,sysreg:
> +    $ref: /schemas/types.yaml#/definitions/phandle
> +    description:
> +      Phandle to system registers interface.


Your description should say here: for what purpose, how this device is
going to use it.

> +
>  required:
>    - compatible
>    - "#clock-cells"
